                    Browse freely and login when you are ready
                    to continue with your order.
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="row g-4">

                <div class="col-md-3">

                    <div class="step">

                        <div class="step-number">1</div>

                        <h5>Explore Shops</h5>

                        <p>
                            Browse wedding shops and discover
                            different collections.
                        </p>

                        <div class="step-line"></div>

                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="col-md-3">

                    <div class="step">

                        <div class="step-number">2</div>

                        <h5>Choose Your Product</h5>

                        <p>
                            View product details and select
                            your preferred available option.
                        </p>

                        <div class="step-line"></div>

                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="col-md-3">

                    <div class="step">

                        <div class="step-number">3</div>

                        <h5>Login to Order</h5>

                        <p>
                            Login or register when you are ready
                            to continue with your purchase.
                        </p>

                        <div class="step-line"></div>

                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="col-md-3">

                    <div class="step">

                        <div class="step-number">4</div>

                        <h5>Complete Checkout</h5>

                        <p>
                            Enter delivery and payment information
                            and place your order.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>



